@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+# Model-history compatibility patch
+
+The Apache-2.0 patch applies to agent-harness-go
+v0.0.3-0.20260909203225-dd886fea04d3. Its owning source is
+pkg/provider/shared_client.go and its focused regression test in that project.
+
+MemoryLayer may persist one assistant bubble containing multiple tool-call/result
+cycles. The shared model adapter must expand that bubble into ordered assistant
+segments and one tool message per result before Chat Completions encoding.
+Otherwise a restarted Sahara worker rejects an existing thread before contacting
+the gateway. The original persisted history is unchanged.
+
+The Sahara Dockerfile downloads and verifies the pinned public Go module, applies
+this reviewed patch to a separate build directory and uses a local module
+replacement only inside that build. The integration compatibility manifest records
+this patch and the resulting image ID. Remove the patch when consuming an upstream
+release containing the fix. This is not a new published dependency release.
